.DS_Store
.build/
.swiftpm/
DerivedData/
*.app
*.dSYM
dist/

# Historical design notes stay local; the backend contract is versioned.
/docs/*
!/docs/backend/

# The backend lives in its own repository — gitlab.com:lqSky7/swiftterm-backend — and is versioned
# there. It is a separate deliverable with its own deploy and its own release cadence, and carrying a
# second copy here meant two histories for one service: the copy in this repository drifted from the
# deployed one and nothing noticed, because a `GRANT` that is missing does not fail.
#
# The contract it shares with this app is *not* ignored: `contracts/` is the frozen wire format and
# `docs/backend/` is the specification, and both are versioned here because both are halves of an
# agreement this repository's code has to keep.
#
# One consequence worth knowing: `git subtree push --prefix=backend` no longer works, because there is
# no longer a subtree. Work on the backend in its own checkout.
/backend/
